<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This class allows conversion between UTF-8 and boost::filesystem::path. The conversions are no-op on Linux, but perform conversion on Windows. </para>
</sect1>
